Create a modern desktop Canvas Power App called “Portfolio & Governance Dashboard” for a pharmaceutical portfolio management team.
Use a clean enterprise layout with a white/light-gray background, a muted coral/red top header, blue accent for the selected navigation item, dark gray text, subtle borders, and minimal shadows. The design should look professional, accessible, and suitable for Microsoft Power Apps.
